flowchart TD
  Start("Start: Simulate G samples 
  of categorical data from a Dirichlet Multinomial
  distribution at each point in the proportion simplex
  with fixed theta and log-uniform samples sizes 📊")
  FitModels{"Fit 3 parameterizations of Dirichlet Multinomial
  to the simulated categorical data"}
  Estimation("Estimate proportion parameters for each form
  at each simulated point in the proportion simplex")
  RMSE("Compute RMSE at each point for accuracy comparison ⚖️")
  Results("Summarize RMSE results")
  Plots("Generate ternary RMSE plots 📈")
  Stats("Statistics and additional metrics")
  Output("Output results & visualizations 📂")

  Start-->FitModels
  FitModels-->Estimation
  Estimation-->RMSE
  RMSE-->Results
  Results-->Plots
  Results-->Stats
  Stats-->Output
  Plots-->Output
